            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.368,
                0.435,
                0.385
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2)序列位置取值: \\(n\\) 只能取整数",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.421,
                0.463,
                0.438
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3)数字角频率与模拟角频率的关系",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.145,
                0.448,
                0.777,
                0.466
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\(f(t) = \\cos \\Omega t\\) 其中 \\(\\Omega\\) 是模拟角频率； \\(f(n) = \\cos \\omega n\\) 其中 \\(\\omega\\) 是数字角频率",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.233,
                0.475,
                0.763,
                0.494
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf (n T _ {s}) = f (n) = \\cos \\Omega \\cdot n T _ {s} = \\cos \\Omega T _ {s} \\cdot n = \\cos \\omega n \\Rightarrow \\omega = \\Omega T _ {s}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.526,
                0.686,
                0.544
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、序列表示：表达式法；图形法；集合法(强调位置与幅值)",
